# tui-015 / oneclick reds — diagnosis, repair and local evidence

Wave: tui-015-adaptation.  Subject: the two oneclick-only QA-case failures of the Docker ONECLICK lane
at `evidence/docker/client-install-oneclick/2026-10-14T14-56-53Z` (118 assertions, 111 pass / 2 FAIL /
5 NULL), whose SOURCE twin `evidence/docker/client-install/2026-10-14T14-47-47Z` (114/0/4, exit 0)
passed the SAME two cases.  No Docker was available to this seat: everything below is measured against
the container's own logs plus a local reproduction of the oneclick condition (see §5).

